Q: Increment on non-numeric string is deprecated, use str_increment() instead A: <h1>create str_increment for php 7</h1>
<p>I created this function in php 7. When upgrade to php 8 it will be ignored and use the native function.</p>
<pre class="lang-php prettyprint-override"><code>if (!function_exists('str_increment')) {
   function str_increment($val) {
      return ++$val;
   }
}
</code></pre>
